---
<BaseLayout lang={lang} title={L('주요 수행 프로젝트 및 연구', 'Key projects and research')} description={L('상수도 누수 탐지, 온실 환경 시계열 예측, LLM Agent 컨설팅 리포트 프로젝트 3건과, 해양 수온·3D 치아 스캔·건설 계약 조항·악성 댓글 논문 4편을 문제와 해결 과정으로 정리함.', 'Three projects (water-leak detection, greenhouse forecasting, LLM-agent reports) and four papers (sea temperature, 3D dental scans, construction contracts, hateful comments), told problem by problem.')}>
  <header class="cs-hero"><div class="shell">
    <a class="cs-back" href={portfolioHref}>← {L('포트폴리오', 'Portfolio')}</a>
    <div class="section-kicker"><LabMark id="portfolio" />{L('포트폴리오 / 주요 수행 프로젝트 및 연구', 'Portfolio / Key projects and research')}</div>
    <h1>{L('현장 데이터를', 'Field data,')} <em>{L('운영 서비스로', 'shipped as services')}</em></h1>
    <p class="cs-lede">{L('기록이 불완전하고 변수가 얽힌 현장 데이터를 정리해, 담당자와 농가가 매일 쓰는 서비스로 납품한 프로젝트 3건. 각 프로젝트에서 부딪힌 문제와 푼 방법을 순서대로 정리하고, 아래에 주요 논문 4편을 붙임.', 'Three projects where messy, incomplete field data became services that operators and growers use every day, each told through the problems it hit and how they were solved, followed by four key papers.')}</p>
    <ol class="cs-index">
      {cases.map((c, i) => (
        <li><a href={`#${c.id}`}>
          <span class="cs-index-no">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
          <span class="cs-index-field">{c.field}</span>
          <strong>{c.title}</strong>
          <span class="cs-index-metric">{metricLine(c)}</span>
        </a></li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </div></header>

  <nav class="cs-nav" aria-label={L('프로젝트', 'Projects')}><div class="shell">
    {cases.map((c, i) => <a href={`#${c.id}`}><span>{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>{c.title}</a>)}
    <a href="#research"><span>R</span>{L('주요 연구', 'Key research')}</a>
  </div></nav>

  <div class="shell cs-body">
    {cases.map((c, ci) => (
      <section class="cs-case" id={c.id} aria-labelledby={`${c.id}-title`}>
        <div class="cs-head">
          <span class="cs-no">{String(ci + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
          <div>
            <p class="cs-eyebrow">{c.field}<i>·</i>{c.meta}</p>
            <h2 id={`${c.id}-title`}>{c.title}</h2>
            <p class="cs-copy">{c.lede}</p>
            <p class="cs-stack">{c.stack.map((s) => <span>{s}</span>)}</p>
          </div>
          <dl class="cs-metrics">
            {c.metrics.map((m) => <div><dt>{m.v}</dt><dd>{m.k}{m.d && <small>{m.d}</small>}</dd></div>)}
          </dl>
        </div>

        <div class="cs-service">
          <figure class="cs-mock" aria-label={L('서비스 화면 예시', 'Example service screen')}>
            {c.id === 'leak' && (
              <div class="cs-win">
                <div class="cs-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>water-leak-detection / dashboard</span></div>
                <div class="cs-pane">
                  <div class="cs-pane-head"><b>{L('실시간 유량 모니터링 · AI 탐지', 'Live flow monitoring · AI detection')}</b><em class="is-alert">{L('누수 의심 2건', '2 suspected leaks')}</em></div>
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 400 150" class="cs-chart" role="img" aria-label={L('하루 유량 곡선과 EMA 기준선, 누수 의심 지점', 'A day of flow with the EMA baseline and suspected leak points')}>
                    <g class="cs-grid"><path d="M0 30H400M0 70H400M0 110H400" /></g>
                    <path class="cs-area" d="M0 95C30 92 50 100 70 88S95 70 105 72 120 120 130 128 150 60 175 48 220 62 240 70 270 52 290 30 330 40 350 80 380 105 400 110V150H0Z" />
                    <path class="cs-line" d="M0 95C30 92 50 100 70 88S95 70 105 72 120 120 130 128 150 60 175 48 220 62 240 70 270 52 290 30 330 40 350 80 380 105 400 110" />
                    <path class="cs-dash" d="M0 104C30 102 50 106 70 99S95 86 105 88 120 114 130 121 150 74 175 62 220 70 240 77 270 63 290 45 330 52 350 88 380 110 400 114" />
                    <g class="cs-dots"><circle cx="70" cy="88" r="4" /><circle cx="86" cy="76" r="4" /><circle cx="100" cy="72" r="4" /></g>
                    <g class="cs-axis"><text x="0" y="146">0{L('시', 'h')}</text><text x="96" y="146">6</text><text x="196" y="146">12</text><text x="296" y="146">18</text><text x="380" y="146">24</text></g>
                  </svg>
                  <p class="cs-legend"><span class="is-line">{L('실시간 유량', 'Flow')}</span><span class="is-dash">{L('EMA 기준선', 'EMA baseline')}</span><span class="is-dot">{L('누수 의심', 'Suspected leak')}</span></p>
                  <table class="cs-table">
                    <thead><tr><th>{L('시간', 'Time')}</th><th>{L('구역', 'Block')}</th><th>{L('상태', 'Status')}</th><th>{L('신뢰도', 'Conf.')}</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>
                      <tr><td>03:20</td><td>A-12</td><td class="is-alert">{L('누수 의심', 'Leak')}</td><td>92%</td></tr>
                      <tr><td>04:15</td><td>B-05</td><td class="is-alert">{L('누수 의심', 'Leak')}</td><td>88%</td></tr>
                      <tr><td>05:30</td><td>C-09</td><td class="is-warn">{L('주의 필요', 'Watch')}</td><td>65%</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                  </table>
                </div>
              </div>
            )}
            {c.id === 'greenhouse' && (
              <div class="cs-win">
                <div class="cs-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>smart-greenhouse / control-simulation</span></div>
                <div class="cs-pane">
                  <div class="cs-pane-head"><b>{L('온실 환경 예측 · 시뮬레이션 (온도)', 'Climate forecast · simulation (temperature)')}</b><em class="is-ok">{L('AI 제어 모드 ON', 'AI control ON')}</em></div>
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 400 150" class="cs-chart" role="img" aria-label={L('13시까지의 실측 온도와 20시까지의 AI 예측 온도', 'Measured temperature to 13:00 and the AI forecast to 20:00')}>
                    <g class="cs-grid"><path d="M0 50H400M0 100H400" /></g>
                    <path class="cs-area" d="M0 95L40 80L80 62L120 48V150H0Z" />
                    <path class="cs-now" d="M120 8V136" />
                    <polyline class="cs-line" points="0,95 40,80 80,62 120,48" />
                    <polyline class="cs-dash is-accent" points="120,48 160,55 200,62 240,88 280,105 320,118 360,125 400,132" />
                    <g class="cs-dots is-pen"><circle cx="0" cy="95" r="3.5" /><circle cx="40" cy="80" r="3.5" /><circle cx="80" cy="62" r="3.5" /><circle cx="120" cy="48" r="3.5" /></g>
                    <g class="cs-dots"><circle cx="160" cy="55" r="3" /><circle cx="200" cy="62" r="3" /><circle cx="240" cy="88" r="3" /><circle cx="280" cy="105" r="3" /><circle cx="320" cy="118" r="3" /><circle cx="360" cy="125" r="3" /></g>
                    <g class="cs-axis"><text x="2" y="146">10:00</text><text x="104" y="146">13:00</text><text x="226" y="146">16:00</text><text x="362" y="146">20:00</text><text x="124" y="18">{L('지금', 'now')}</text><text x="380" y="46">25℃</text><text x="380" y="96">20℃</text></g>
                  </svg>
                  <p class="cs-legend"><span class="is-line">{L('실측 온도', 'Measured')}</span><span class="is-dash is-accent">{L('AI 예측 온도', 'AI forecast')}</span></p>
                  <table class="cs-table">
                    <thead><tr><th>{L('시간', 'Time')}</th><th>{L('예상 온도', 'Forecast')}</th><th>{L('천창', 'Vent')}</th><th>{L('난방기', 'Heater')}</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>
                      <tr><td>14:00</td><td>24.5℃</td><td><b>{L('개방 30%', 'Open 30%')}</b></td><td>OFF</td></tr>
                      <tr><td>15:00</td><td>23.8℃</td><td><b>{L('개방 10%', 'Open 10%')}</b></td><td>OFF</td></tr>
                      <tr><td>16:00</td><td>21.2℃</td><td>{L('닫힘', 'Closed')}</td><td class="is-alert">{L('ON (1단계)', 'ON (stage 1)')}</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                  </table>
                </div>
              </div>
            )}
            {c.id === 'report' && (
              <div class="cs-win is-doc">
                <div class="cs-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>smart-farm-consulting / report.pdf</span></div>
                <div class="cs-paper">
                  <div class="cs-paper-head"><b>{L('딸기 생육 주간 컨설팅 리포트', 'Weekly strawberry growth report')}</b><span>{L('3월 2주차', 'March, week 2')}</span></div>
